Lexicographically earliest infinite sequence of distinct positive numbers such that, for n > 2, a(n) shares a factor with a(n-1) while the set of distinct prime factors shared between a(n) and a(n-1) differs from that shared between a(n-1) and a(n-2).

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

